1
00:01:36,270 --> 00:01:40,100
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,130 --> 00:01:42,990
[Episode 19: Tied Braised Pork Belly]

3
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,120
Bro, hang in there.

4
00:01:45,470 --> 00:01:46,450
We're almost there.

5
00:01:46,450 --> 00:01:47,470
Hang in there.

6
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:48,590
We're almost there.

7
00:01:48,590 --> 00:01:49,620
Guys, give me a hand!

8
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:50,090
Hurry!

9
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:50,960
Quick!

10
00:01:54,140 --> 00:01:55,020
[Licorice]

11
00:02:05,230 --> 00:02:06,230
Okay, don't move.

12
00:02:51,540 --> 00:02:52,060
Yulu.

13
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:53,950
Have you applied the medicine?

14
00:02:53,950 --> 00:02:56,280
I've already applied the wound medicine.

15
00:03:01,290 --> 00:03:01,950
Aunt Hong.

16
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:04,980
It must hurt a lot.

17
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,750
This wound is nothing.

18
00:03:20,070 --> 00:03:21,600
You told me about it before.

19
00:03:22,579 --> 00:03:24,110
Was the situation that year

20
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,770
as tragic as today?

21
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,260
It was...

22
00:03:35,310 --> 00:03:36,770
ten thousand times worse.

23
00:03:42,810 --> 00:03:43,420
Dingyuan.

24
00:03:43,579 --> 00:03:47,040
There are still many of Tie Xuan's
old subordinates and their families here.

25
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,700
If you still have some energy,

26
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:51,710
I hope you can escort them
on their journey.

27
00:03:58,070 --> 00:03:58,660
Go!

28
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:04,110
Where is the doctor I asked you to find?

29
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:06,040
There are too many injured people outside.

30
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,310
Doctors both inside and outside the city

31
00:04:07,310 --> 00:04:08,350
are all saving the people
coming down the mountain.

32
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:09,950
Can you keep your voice down?

33
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:13,630
Didn't you see how pale Leader looks?

34
00:04:13,630 --> 00:04:14,630
Little Leaf.

35
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:17,630
Have He Si go outside to help.

36
00:04:18,010 --> 00:04:19,130
My condition

37
00:04:19,779 --> 00:04:22,180
can't be cured
just by having a doctor here.

38
00:04:22,950 --> 00:04:23,550
Go!

39
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:36,750
[Jimin Clinic]

40
00:04:40,170 --> 00:04:41,100
Excuse me.

41
00:04:41,140 --> 00:04:41,940
Hang in there.

42
00:04:43,130 --> 00:04:44,070
Doctor! Doctor!

43
00:04:44,590 --> 00:04:45,620
An old man is sick.

44
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:47,250
Could you please go take a look?

45
00:04:47,250 --> 00:04:47,930
As you can see,

46
00:04:47,930 --> 00:04:49,630
many wounded came down
from the mountain this morning.

47
00:04:49,630 --> 00:04:50,990
There are only two of us here.

48
00:04:50,990 --> 00:04:52,250
We're really too busy.

49
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,820
Medicine coming right up!

50
00:04:53,820 --> 00:04:54,580
Doctor...

51
00:05:03,430 --> 00:05:04,220
Bear with it.

52
00:05:05,330 --> 00:05:06,620
Your wound isn't deep.

53
00:05:06,950 --> 00:05:08,410
I've applied antiseptic.

54
00:05:09,260 --> 00:05:10,120
You'll be fine.

55
00:05:11,110 --> 00:05:12,440
It'll heal in a few days.

56
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:14,430
Don't drink alcohol for 7 days,

57
00:05:14,430 --> 00:05:15,250
and don't get it wet.

58
00:05:15,250 --> 00:05:16,320
Okay. Thank you, Doctor.

59
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:17,250
You're welcome.

60
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:23,070
Doctor Su.

61
00:05:23,700 --> 00:05:24,900
Why are you in Jinan?

62
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:27,870
I've been looking for you all along.

63
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:28,840
Where is Wu Dingyuan?

64
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:29,790
Is he with you?

65
00:05:30,150 --> 00:05:30,750
Yes.

66
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:53,200
Good-for-Nothing.

67
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:55,340
Doctor Su?

68
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:59,020
Why are you here in Jinan?

69
00:05:59,020 --> 00:06:00,510
Weren't you with the Crown Prince?

70
00:06:00,510 --> 00:06:02,170
The Crown Prince is in danger.

71
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:06,760
I can't care about that much right now.

72
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:07,460
Why?

73
00:06:08,810 --> 00:06:09,610
What's wrong?

74
00:06:36,570 --> 00:06:37,260
Granny.

75
00:06:38,290 --> 00:06:39,960
Did you take your medicine just now?

76
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:40,780
I did.

77
00:06:41,550 --> 00:06:43,810
Then I'll give you something delicious.

78
00:06:44,220 --> 00:06:45,070
What is it?

79
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:47,700
Here.

80
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:55,190
You still love to eat so much.

81
00:06:57,780 --> 00:06:59,510
I remember when I picked you up.

82
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,880
You were in a pile of dead bodies,

83
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:01,970
yet your little hands

84
00:07:01,970 --> 00:07:05,050
were still clutching onto
half a blackened steamed bun.

85
00:07:05,050 --> 00:07:06,220
When I pulled you out

86
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:08,150
and fed you your first sip of water,

87
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:10,320
your eyes weren't even open yet.

88
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,750
Yet your mouth

89
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,270
was already smacking.

90
00:07:19,510 --> 00:07:20,870
Later, when you grew up,

91
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:23,020
you ate when you were happy,

92
00:07:23,220 --> 00:07:25,080
and ate when you were unhappy too.

93
00:07:25,130 --> 00:07:25,870
It's like...

94
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:29,400
by stuffing
a lifetime of food into yourself,

95
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,690
you could suppress all the past

96
00:07:32,490 --> 00:07:33,460
hunger,

97
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,260
fear,

98
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:37,070
and suffering—

99
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,750
and finally feel safe.

100
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:52,580
Little Leaf.

101
00:07:55,380 --> 00:07:57,780
He Si is an honest boy.

102
00:07:58,430 --> 00:08:00,320
I'm counting on him
to take care of you in the future.

103
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,700
Don't be so mean to him.

104
00:08:01,930 --> 00:08:04,460
Granny, I don't need anyone
to take care of me.

105
00:08:04,850 --> 00:08:06,460
I just want you to be well.

106
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:11,750
Silly girl.

107
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:16,090
I have been sick for a long time now.

108
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:21,380
After I'm gone,

109
00:08:23,010 --> 00:08:26,260
someone has to
carry the Iron Alliance banner.

110
00:08:29,130 --> 00:08:30,190
Young Master Tie

111
00:08:30,690 --> 00:08:32,190
is Tie Xuan's bloodline.

112
00:08:32,860 --> 00:08:35,150
You must treat him as you treat me.

113
00:08:37,049 --> 00:08:38,100
Listen to him

114
00:08:38,789 --> 00:08:39,740
and protect him.

115
00:08:40,950 --> 00:08:41,820
Understood?

116
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:49,740
Go find Young Master Tie.

117
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:53,060
There are things I need to tell him
in person.

118
00:08:55,030 --> 00:08:55,950
Be good.

119
00:08:56,690 --> 00:08:57,310
Go.

120
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,100
Good girl.

121
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:10,800
Good girl.

122
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,860
So the Iron Alliance
has been looking for you

123
00:09:22,860 --> 00:09:24,790
because you are Tie Xuan's son.

124
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,310
Give me a reason

125
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:29,980
to save the grandson
of the man who killed my father.

126
00:09:32,980 --> 00:09:34,240
I respect your choice.

127
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:36,880
But I also need to tell you something.

128
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:38,070
Go ahead.

129
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:41,430
The Crown Prince
came to Jinan to save you.

130
00:09:41,500 --> 00:09:43,460
But he has been captured by Jin Rong.

131
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:44,990
Why would he come to save me?

132
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:48,620
Is there anything more important
right now than returning to the capital?

133
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:51,070
He was afraid
the Iron Alliance would kill you.

134
00:09:51,070 --> 00:09:52,820
He's crazy.

135
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,490
Where is Little Xingren?

136
00:09:54,490 --> 00:09:56,360
Wait, why didn't Little Xingren stop him?

137
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,200
Rectifier Yu couldn't talk him out of it.

138
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:00,600
He was sent to Beijing
to see Marquis Zhang.

139
00:10:01,430 --> 00:10:02,480
He was very determined,

140
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,860
dead set on saving you.

141
00:10:04,100 --> 00:10:06,530
He also said if he couldn't even save you,

142
00:10:07,390 --> 00:10:09,120
he wouldn't be fit to be a ruler.

143
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:10,550
He's sick in the head.

144
00:10:11,310 --> 00:10:12,310
How was he caught?

145
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:17,210
He went to the Zhongwu Shrine.

146
00:10:17,220 --> 00:10:18,950
He didn't let me follow him
in case of danger.

147
00:10:18,950 --> 00:10:21,350
From a distance,
I saw him being taken away.

148
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:23,580
I followed him all the way
to Jin Rong's residence.

149
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:25,200
There was no movement after he went in.

150
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,800
[Unfilial son, Tie Fuyuan]

151
00:10:27,890 --> 00:10:29,670
I wanted to find someone to help,

152
00:10:29,670 --> 00:10:31,030
so I searched all the way here.

153
00:10:31,030 --> 00:10:32,030
I bumped into He Si

154
00:10:33,070 --> 00:10:34,600
and found out you were here.

155
00:10:38,650 --> 00:10:39,950
If you are Tie Fuyuan,

156
00:10:40,530 --> 00:10:41,530
you can just sit back and watch

157
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:43,260
the Zhu family kill each other.

158
00:10:43,670 --> 00:10:45,190
But if you are Wu Dingyuan,

159
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:48,550
and a true friend is in danger today,

160
00:10:49,740 --> 00:10:50,740
what would you do?

161
00:10:56,030 --> 00:10:58,030
Then I'll leave it to heaven's will.

162
00:11:03,980 --> 00:11:06,040
If it shows the characters "Yongle,"

163
00:11:06,570 --> 00:11:09,550
it means the grudge between
the Zhu and Tie families cannot be resolved.

164
00:11:09,550 --> 00:11:10,390
If it's blank,

165
00:11:10,890 --> 00:11:11,890
I will go save him.

166
00:11:21,690 --> 00:11:22,490
One more time.

167
00:11:23,210 --> 00:11:24,340
That was a bit hasty.

168
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,130
No need for this.

169
00:11:30,500 --> 00:11:32,150
You have already made up your mind.

170
00:11:32,150 --> 00:11:33,610
Why look to heaven's will?

171
00:11:37,310 --> 00:11:38,310
Young Master Tie,

172
00:11:38,390 --> 00:11:39,720
Leader wants to see you.

173
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:44,160
I'll come back and toss it again later.

174
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:02,430
What does the pulse say?

175
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:04,410
The illness is in the pericardium,

176
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:06,610
and the disaster is in the two chambers.

177
00:12:07,860 --> 00:12:08,990
Can I still be saved?

178
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:10,960
Applying a few needles

179
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,850
can relieve it a bit.

180
00:12:18,980 --> 00:12:20,270
Meeting

181
00:12:20,930 --> 00:12:22,990
Young Master Fuyuan in this lifetime

182
00:12:23,410 --> 00:12:25,460
is fate, not a disaster.

183
00:12:26,670 --> 00:12:27,950
My time is almost up.

184
00:12:28,860 --> 00:12:30,520
There's no need to relieve it.

185
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:38,550
I have a favor

186
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:40,950
to ask of you.

187
00:12:45,550 --> 00:12:46,750
I'll go help outside.

188
00:12:50,790 --> 00:12:51,340
Granny,

189
00:12:51,670 --> 00:12:52,600
please sit down.

190
00:12:52,890 --> 00:12:53,740
Sit, sit.

191
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,740
Young Master Tie, you sit too.

192
00:12:56,220 --> 00:12:57,030
Sit down.

193
00:13:03,070 --> 00:13:04,200
I raised Little Leaf

194
00:13:04,580 --> 00:13:06,190
single-handedly.

195
00:13:06,430 --> 00:13:07,670
She's indeed a girl,

196
00:13:08,190 --> 00:13:10,190
but her temper is fiercer than fire.

197
00:13:10,310 --> 00:13:11,820
I entrust her to you.

198
00:13:12,100 --> 00:13:13,760
You now have a younger sister.

199
00:13:14,650 --> 00:13:16,650
She will protect you in everything,

200
00:13:16,650 --> 00:13:19,390
and you must protect her too.

201
00:13:19,770 --> 00:13:20,970
Granny, don't worry.

202
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:23,350
I will definitely keep her safe.

203
00:13:26,620 --> 00:13:27,950
There is one more person

204
00:13:28,070 --> 00:13:29,670
I need to tell you about.

205
00:13:32,070 --> 00:13:33,390
Liang Xingfu.

206
00:13:33,910 --> 00:13:34,500
Granny,

207
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:36,360
I can't control this man.

208
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:38,350
I can't hold him back.

209
00:13:39,450 --> 00:13:42,670
He was your father's
most loyal subordinate back then.

210
00:13:43,310 --> 00:13:44,620
When Jinan fell,

211
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:47,850
he watched Tie Xuan
be executed with his own eyes.

212
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:49,670
Not long after,

213
00:13:50,910 --> 00:13:53,190
he went to Jinling alone

214
00:13:54,340 --> 00:13:56,100
to rescue Tie Xuan's family.

215
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,750
His pursuit along the way

216
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:00,430
was because the Prince of Han

217
00:14:00,430 --> 00:14:02,960
threatened the lives
of the entire alliance.

218
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,050
So you're saying

219
00:14:05,670 --> 00:14:07,740
he tried to kill me time and again

220
00:14:08,950 --> 00:14:10,410
just because I stopped him

221
00:14:11,280 --> 00:14:13,010
from killing the Crown Prince?

222
00:14:17,340 --> 00:14:18,100
Yes.

223
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:20,270
He was just following my orders.

224
00:14:20,270 --> 00:14:22,340
The Iron Alliance
has been besieged for years.

225
00:14:22,340 --> 00:14:23,940
We just want a way to survive.

226
00:14:25,260 --> 00:14:28,260
He now knows your background.

227
00:14:33,980 --> 00:14:34,580
Granny.

228
00:14:37,220 --> 00:14:38,950
Actually, I have a favor to ask.

229
00:14:39,170 --> 00:14:41,030
But I don't know if I should say it.

230
00:14:41,860 --> 00:14:44,190
I want to use the power
of the Iron Alliance

231
00:14:44,340 --> 00:14:45,270
to save someone.

232
00:14:47,070 --> 00:14:48,930
There's no need to ask for favors.

233
00:14:49,430 --> 00:14:51,220
As long as you take over
as the Alliance Leader,

234
00:14:51,220 --> 00:14:52,980
it's just a matter of your word.

235
00:14:53,570 --> 00:14:55,500
How can I, Dingyuan, be worthy?

236
00:14:56,650 --> 00:14:57,910
Dingyuan has the word destiny in it—

237
00:14:57,910 --> 00:14:59,310
so does Fuyuan.

238
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:01,620
You are destined for it.

239
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,320
Since it's destined,

240
00:15:03,890 --> 00:15:05,430
you can't push it away.

241
00:15:06,100 --> 00:15:06,790
Granny.

242
00:15:07,690 --> 00:15:08,670
I really cannot

243
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:10,500
be the Alliance Leader.

244
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:11,950
I'm afraid I'll let you down.

245
00:15:11,950 --> 00:15:13,500
I can't be wrong.

246
00:15:14,390 --> 00:15:16,620
I saw you risking your life

247
00:15:16,790 --> 00:15:19,390
to save that little brat
on the mountain today.

248
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:20,790
If you weren't a benevolent leader,

249
00:15:20,790 --> 00:15:22,390
you wouldn't have done such a good deed.

250
00:15:22,390 --> 00:15:23,980
I entrust them to you.

251
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:26,370
You will definitely not let them down.

252
00:15:26,810 --> 00:15:27,460
Granny.

253
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:29,430
That was just an impulse.

254
00:15:29,670 --> 00:15:31,470
Anyone would have done the same.

255
00:15:31,910 --> 00:15:34,790
Tie Xuan's uprising back then
was also an impulse.

256
00:15:36,190 --> 00:15:37,740
An impulsive act

257
00:15:38,860 --> 00:15:40,740
can lead to a lifelong trust.

258
00:15:45,550 --> 00:15:46,220
Come.

259
00:15:48,170 --> 00:15:49,770
Let me take you to have a look,

260
00:15:51,350 --> 00:15:53,350
and then you can make your decision.

261
00:16:00,810 --> 00:16:01,550
Look.

262
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:04,150
Our Iron Alliance

263
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:07,300
isn't as omnipotent as you said.

264
00:16:08,540 --> 00:16:09,970
We have experienced

265
00:16:10,260 --> 00:16:12,260
what we are seeing now so many times.

266
00:16:12,580 --> 00:16:14,670
But to survive,

267
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:15,820
one must

268
00:16:16,150 --> 00:16:17,220
endure.

269
00:16:22,880 --> 00:16:24,020
That old cripple

270
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:26,460
was your father's old subordinate.

271
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:27,920
He was crippled in battle.

272
00:16:28,780 --> 00:16:30,190
His son and daughter

273
00:16:30,570 --> 00:16:32,500
were killed by Jin Rong.

274
00:16:49,790 --> 00:16:51,270
Xiaoqi's parents

275
00:16:51,500 --> 00:16:53,030
died on the mountain today.

276
00:16:53,310 --> 00:16:54,980
Thank god you saved him.

277
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:58,540
We brought him back
to take care of him for now.

278
00:17:11,940 --> 00:17:13,589
He Si and Little Leaf,

279
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:16,200
I dug them out of a pile of dead bodies.

280
00:17:17,250 --> 00:17:19,030
He Si's own sister passed away,

281
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,050
so he treats Little Leaf

282
00:17:21,730 --> 00:17:23,329
like his own sister.

283
00:17:24,170 --> 00:17:25,150
I know him.

284
00:17:25,339 --> 00:17:27,660
He was helping the Prince of Han
kill the Crown Prince.

285
00:17:27,660 --> 00:17:30,370
But he's also the one
who helped me save the Crown Prince.

286
00:17:30,370 --> 00:17:32,790
He helped the Prince of Han to survive,

287
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:35,890
and now he rebels against
the Prince of Han to survive too.

288
00:17:35,890 --> 00:17:37,220
What's wrong with that?

289
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:43,200
He Si!

290
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:45,780
He Si, bring some more ointment!

291
00:17:46,210 --> 00:17:46,860
Coming.

292
00:17:56,100 --> 00:17:57,040
You have seen

293
00:17:57,430 --> 00:17:58,670
all of this.

294
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,150
What I see

295
00:18:02,110 --> 00:18:03,150
are people

296
00:18:04,260 --> 00:18:05,720
who want to live a good life

297
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:07,950
but struggle to survive.

298
00:18:08,590 --> 00:18:09,720
They farm and weave,

299
00:18:10,830 --> 00:18:12,030
just to eat and dress,

300
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:14,840
yet they are oppressed like this.

301
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:16,350
Over the years,

302
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:17,720
the Iron Alliance

303
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:20,020
has been trying its best to protect them.

304
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:22,420
But now I have a terminal illness,

305
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:24,340
and the Iron Alliance is also terminally ill—

306
00:18:24,340 --> 00:18:26,270
there is no way out for either of us.

307
00:18:26,670 --> 00:18:28,150
It doesn't matter if I die.

308
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:31,670
But these people have to live on.

309
00:18:32,950 --> 00:18:33,590
Granny.

310
00:18:38,630 --> 00:18:39,630
Young Master Tie,

311
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:44,110
are you willing to lead them

312
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:45,670
to survive?

313
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:49,460
Granny,

314
00:18:50,540 --> 00:18:51,960
taking over as the Alliance Leader

315
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:53,190
is no small matter.

316
00:18:53,830 --> 00:18:55,830
I dare not make such a hasty promise.

317
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:57,130
Besides, right now,

318
00:18:59,150 --> 00:19:00,810
I am in a hurry to save someone.

319
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:02,730
The person you want to save,

320
00:19:03,060 --> 00:19:04,320
is it the Crown Prince?

321
00:19:05,740 --> 00:19:06,540
That's right.

322
00:19:08,530 --> 00:19:09,570
In your eyes,

323
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,210
what kind of person is he?

324
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:23,300
♪ Across heaven and earth, as the winds
wander, when shall I return home? ♪

325
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:19,740
Good-for-Nothing, go!

326
00:19:20,630 --> 00:19:22,890
Good-for-Nothing, Good-for-Nothing!

327
00:19:23,130 --> 00:19:23,980
-Go!
-Go!

328
00:19:23,330 --> 00:19:31,800
♪ Against a fate I can't fathom,
who is truly my foe? ♪

329
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:25,220
-Go!
-Go!

330
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:29,380
-Go!
-Father!

331
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:29,980
Father!

332
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:30,700
Go!

333
00:19:31,110 --> 00:19:31,950
Run.

334
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:40,060
♪ Where shall tomorrow lead me,
and who will share my cup? ♪

335
00:19:32,190 --> 00:19:33,060
Dad!

336
00:19:35,500 --> 00:19:36,060
Go!

337
00:19:36,740 --> 00:19:37,350
Go!

338
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:48,060
♪ The northern sky stretches wide,
with one lone star aglow ♪

339
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:46,910
You think you can

340
00:19:46,910 --> 00:19:48,220
save your sister now?

341
00:19:50,410 --> 00:19:53,560
♪ Life's journey is but a fleeting dream ♪

342
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:52,970
Let's get out of here first.

343
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:54,630
When everything is settled,

344
00:19:54,630 --> 00:19:55,700
I will definitely help you save her!

345
00:19:54,730 --> 00:19:58,560
♪ In this turbulent age,
all things pass in haste ♪

346
00:19:56,170 --> 00:19:57,030
Dragon Head...

347
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:03,220
♪ I wonder what may come
and how things will be ♪

348
00:20:03,260 --> 00:20:04,320
The imperial court

349
00:20:05,950 --> 00:20:07,830
never listens to only
one side of the story.

350
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:10,770
♪ Waves rise high,
with storms brewing below ♪

351
00:20:08,370 --> 00:20:09,460
If you trust me,

352
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:11,060
one day,

353
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:15,800
♪ With my blade turned north,
I chart my course by the stars ♪

354
00:20:12,410 --> 00:20:14,540
if I make it out in one piece,

355
00:20:15,830 --> 00:20:21,220
♪ I've seen it all,
love and hate entwined ♪

356
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:22,690
I will definitely get you an explanation.

357
00:20:22,100 --> 00:20:30,170
♪ Across heaven and earth, as the winds
wander, when shall I return home? ♪

358
00:20:30,410 --> 00:20:38,370
♪ Against a fate I can't fathom,
who is truly my foe? ♪

359
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:36,540
Whether he will be a good emperor,

360
00:20:37,430 --> 00:20:38,560
I can't say for sure.

361
00:20:38,790 --> 00:20:46,810
♪ Where shall tomorrow lead me,
and who will share my cup? ♪

362
00:20:40,630 --> 00:20:41,780
But along the way,

363
00:20:42,110 --> 00:20:42,840
he has indeed

364
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:44,110
suffered a lot.

365
00:20:44,980 --> 00:20:46,640
I would have given up long ago.

366
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:54,780
♪ The northern sky stretches wide,
with one lone star aglow ♪

367
00:20:48,910 --> 00:20:49,830
Anyway,

368
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:53,120
he's better than
that Suanni and Prince of Han.

369
00:21:04,110 --> 00:21:06,110
He thought I was in trouble in Jinan,

370
00:21:06,350 --> 00:21:08,170
and came to save me without hesitation,

371
00:21:08,170 --> 00:21:09,820
which is why he was captured
by Jin Rong.

372
00:21:09,820 --> 00:21:10,470
Of course,

373
00:21:10,980 --> 00:21:11,780
I am saving him

374
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:13,590
not just out of

375
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:14,930
a friend's loyalty,

376
00:21:14,950 --> 00:21:15,950
but also to

377
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:18,280
leave a way out for the Iron Alliance.

378
00:21:19,020 --> 00:21:20,110
What do you mean?

379
00:21:21,390 --> 00:21:23,920
The Prince of Han is cruel
and narrow-minded.

380
00:21:24,260 --> 00:21:26,460
He will never let the Iron Alliance off.

381
00:21:26,500 --> 00:21:27,590
But Zhu Zhanji

382
00:21:28,010 --> 00:21:28,810
is different.

383
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:31,540
If he can return to the capital safely

384
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:33,290
and inherit the throne,

385
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:34,130
I want to

386
00:21:35,780 --> 00:21:36,870
ask him for

387
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:38,970
a pardon for the Iron Alliance.

388
00:21:40,130 --> 00:21:41,520
This is also the Iron Alliance's

389
00:21:41,520 --> 00:21:42,650
only way to survive.

390
00:22:02,630 --> 00:22:03,500
I, Jin Rong,

391
00:22:04,500 --> 00:22:06,360
pay my respects to Your Highness.

392
00:22:11,180 --> 00:22:12,030
Jin Si,

393
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:15,960
you're really not good at pretending.

394
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:18,300
But what I didn't expect

395
00:22:20,700 --> 00:22:22,630
is that you actually rebelled too.

396
00:22:26,650 --> 00:22:28,220
I am just following orders.

397
00:22:32,430 --> 00:22:33,190
Right.

398
00:22:34,260 --> 00:22:36,020
A subject obeys his lord's orders.

399
00:22:36,020 --> 00:22:37,220
But I'd like to know,

400
00:22:37,850 --> 00:22:39,910
which lord are you serving, Jin Si?

401
00:22:43,170 --> 00:22:44,110
Where is

402
00:22:44,610 --> 00:22:45,840
Your Highness's injury?

403
00:22:45,840 --> 00:22:47,300
Judging by the treatment,

404
00:22:47,580 --> 00:22:49,510
it seems to be done by the military.

405
00:22:49,670 --> 00:22:51,390
Just speak your mind.

406
00:22:54,300 --> 00:22:55,160
Your Highness.

407
00:22:57,330 --> 00:22:58,980
I don't want to kill you.

408
00:23:06,280 --> 00:23:08,010
It's not that you don't want to,

409
00:23:09,460 --> 00:23:10,830
but you don't dare to.

410
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:14,820
Your Highness.

411
00:23:14,930 --> 00:23:15,910
Back then, I

412
00:23:16,560 --> 00:23:18,990
followed Emperor Taizong into battles,

413
00:23:19,500 --> 00:23:22,560
crawling out of mountains
of corpses and seas of blood.

414
00:23:22,650 --> 00:23:23,670
At that time,

415
00:23:24,060 --> 00:23:25,110
everyone thought

416
00:23:26,280 --> 00:23:27,940
the blood was worth shedding.

417
00:23:30,390 --> 00:23:32,520
But after Emperor Taizong passed away

418
00:23:32,930 --> 00:23:34,990
and your father ascended the throne,

419
00:23:36,220 --> 00:23:37,670
the first edict he issued

420
00:23:38,040 --> 00:23:40,040
was to end war and pacify the people.

421
00:23:43,110 --> 00:23:46,220
He reduced border defenses
and revoked military registrations.

422
00:23:46,220 --> 00:23:48,280
Those soldiers guarding the borders

423
00:23:48,530 --> 00:23:50,590
became useless in the blink of an eye.

424
00:23:54,170 --> 00:23:55,540
How is that peace?

425
00:23:58,660 --> 00:24:00,550
Father did this to pacify the world.

426
00:24:00,550 --> 00:24:02,210
Whose world was he pacifying?

427
00:24:03,780 --> 00:24:05,670
He wanted to pardon those former officials
of the Jingnan Campaign

428
00:24:05,670 --> 00:24:07,270
and rehabilitate them.

429
00:24:08,220 --> 00:24:09,080
Your Highness,

430
00:24:09,460 --> 00:24:11,700
if they are loyal and good officials,

431
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:13,020
then what about us?

432
00:24:13,110 --> 00:24:14,760
What are we who followed Emperor Taizong

433
00:24:14,760 --> 00:24:16,460
to annihilate them?

434
00:24:17,300 --> 00:24:18,160
Your Highness,

435
00:24:18,600 --> 00:24:19,610
have you forgotten those

436
00:24:19,610 --> 00:24:21,780
who went to the battlefield with you?

437
00:24:23,250 --> 00:24:25,110
So you turned to the Prince of Han.

438
00:24:25,610 --> 00:24:26,550
I'd like to know—

439
00:24:27,280 --> 00:24:29,410
what did the Prince of Han promise you?

440
00:24:29,980 --> 00:24:30,840
Your Highness.

441
00:24:33,110 --> 00:24:34,670
What I want is not a reward.

442
00:24:35,220 --> 00:24:35,970
What I want is not to be cast aside

443
00:24:35,970 --> 00:24:39,700
like a hound once the hare is caught,
or a bow once the birds are gone.

444
00:24:42,030 --> 00:24:44,290
You keep saying you're loyal to the court

445
00:24:45,090 --> 00:24:46,420
and to Emperor Taizong.

446
00:24:46,780 --> 00:24:48,110
But if Grandfather knew

447
00:24:48,590 --> 00:24:50,670
about your loyalty in his afterlife,

448
00:24:51,220 --> 00:24:52,880
do you think he'd tolerate it?

449
00:24:57,690 --> 00:24:58,260
General.

450
00:25:03,830 --> 00:25:05,610
A squad of soldiers
has been dispatched from the camp.

451
00:25:05,610 --> 00:25:06,870
Everything is ready.

452
00:25:10,110 --> 00:25:10,840
Understood.

453
00:25:13,980 --> 00:25:15,060
If Emperor Taizong

454
00:25:15,700 --> 00:25:17,630
is really watching from heaven...

455
00:25:23,020 --> 00:25:24,350
why would Your Highness

456
00:25:26,890 --> 00:25:28,600
be in my room at this moment?

457
00:25:31,010 --> 00:25:31,870
Your Highness,

458
00:25:32,850 --> 00:25:34,490
there is something I don't understand.

459
00:25:34,490 --> 00:25:36,640
Why didn't Your Highness
go directly to the capital,

460
00:25:36,640 --> 00:25:38,370
but detoured to Jinan instead?

461
00:25:39,350 --> 00:25:40,540
Do you think I could

462
00:25:40,930 --> 00:25:42,260
just enter the capital?

463
00:25:43,950 --> 00:25:45,150
This detour to Jinan

464
00:25:45,770 --> 00:25:47,330
is just to save someone.

465
00:25:48,170 --> 00:25:49,060
Who is it?

466
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:53,110
Someone similar
to the people who protected me

467
00:25:53,110 --> 00:25:55,890
during your northern expedition.

468
00:25:58,390 --> 00:26:00,190
I would like to hear the details.

469
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:04,580
When my treasure ship was bombed,

470
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:07,510
your people colluded
with the Iron Alliance

471
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:11,000
and wanted to
blow me up directly with explosives.

472
00:26:12,860 --> 00:26:13,910
At that time,

473
00:26:15,080 --> 00:26:17,150
someone pulled me out of the water.

474
00:26:17,910 --> 00:26:19,590
By a strange combination of circumstances,

475
00:26:19,590 --> 00:26:21,390
he brought me into Jinling City.

476
00:26:23,220 --> 00:26:24,480
When we were escaping,

477
00:26:24,490 --> 00:26:26,400
he saved my life several times.

478
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:28,280
♪ When the world mocks absurd wishes ♪

479
00:26:28,190 --> 00:26:28,880
Of course,

480
00:26:28,300 --> 00:26:31,810
♪ You chose to join me in my folly ♪

481
00:26:29,720 --> 00:26:31,400
I also saved him many times.

482
00:26:32,320 --> 00:26:34,950
♪ When people can only share weal ♪

483
00:26:34,980 --> 00:26:38,860
♪ You only wish to share my woe ♪

484
00:26:38,900 --> 00:26:42,020
♪ A heart full of burning passion,
a passion that burns in the heart ♪

485
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:45,160
♪ Battered and bruised all along the way ♪

486
00:26:43,540 --> 00:26:44,670
Good-for-Nothing,

487
00:26:45,180 --> 00:26:48,130
♪ Things I cannot repay you
for in this lifetime ♪

488
00:26:45,280 --> 00:26:46,350
if I ever...

489
00:26:47,950 --> 00:26:49,670
find myself on the brink of death again,

490
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:51,440
♪ I will keep it etched in my heart ♪

491
00:26:50,700 --> 00:26:52,430
would you risk your life to save me?

492
00:26:52,430 --> 00:26:53,430
Risk my life?

493
00:26:53,370 --> 00:26:56,410
♪ Fate branded you and me ♪

494
00:26:54,870 --> 00:26:55,700
No way!

495
00:26:56,500 --> 00:26:57,350
I can't do that.

496
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:59,490
♪ With different surnames and appearances ♪

497
00:26:58,460 --> 00:26:59,390
I knew it.

498
00:27:00,390 --> 00:27:02,630
A coward like you wouldn't save me.

499
00:27:00,480 --> 00:27:03,130
♪ But it doesn't stop us from living as ♪

500
00:27:03,160 --> 00:27:07,150
♪ Each other's brothers
and shoulders to lean on ♪

501
00:27:03,830 --> 00:27:04,500
Fine.

502
00:27:04,700 --> 00:27:06,100
If that day really comes,

503
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:10,110
♪ A time of youth, a youthful journey ♪

504
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:09,530
I won't beg anyone for help.

505
00:27:10,130 --> 00:27:13,680
♪ A single promise
to brave storms together ♪

506
00:27:10,350 --> 00:27:11,950
But you're one of the rare people

507
00:27:11,950 --> 00:27:13,610
who dares to tell me the truth.

508
00:27:13,700 --> 00:27:16,440
♪ In the next life, let it be
my turn to shield you ♪

509
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:19,760
♪ From the hidden arrows
and open spears meant to harm you ♪

510
00:27:20,390 --> 00:27:21,390
So,

511
00:27:22,780 --> 00:27:24,440
he is Your Highness's friend.

512
00:27:26,720 --> 00:27:27,590
Jin Si.

513
00:27:28,060 --> 00:27:29,350
Since I was born,

514
00:27:29,680 --> 00:27:32,080
I was destined
to ascend the dragon throne.

515
00:27:33,540 --> 00:27:34,800
Someone on that throne

516
00:27:35,700 --> 00:27:37,420
does not have friends.

517
00:27:38,700 --> 00:27:39,430
You,

518
00:27:40,220 --> 00:27:41,220
Zhu Bukha,

519
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:44,200
and my worthless brother—

520
00:27:44,720 --> 00:27:46,450
all of you taught me this lesson

521
00:27:47,340 --> 00:27:49,260
along the way.

522
00:27:51,330 --> 00:27:52,870
It seems Your Highness

523
00:27:54,050 --> 00:27:55,910
still wants to ascend the throne.

524
00:27:59,830 --> 00:28:00,830
Is there

525
00:28:01,110 --> 00:28:03,640
Tied Braised Pork Belly
stewing in this room?

526
00:28:03,740 --> 00:28:04,500
Jin Si,

527
00:28:05,910 --> 00:28:07,210
today we're not ruler and subject,

528
00:28:07,210 --> 00:28:08,340
only host and guest.

529
00:28:08,810 --> 00:28:09,940
I am a little hungry.

530
00:28:13,720 --> 00:28:14,580
Your Highness,

531
00:28:15,170 --> 00:28:16,900
since things have come to this,

532
00:28:17,690 --> 00:28:18,610
I hope Your Highness

533
00:28:18,610 --> 00:28:20,940
will no longer have any wishful thinking.

534
00:28:25,220 --> 00:28:26,060
I am guilty.

535
00:28:26,540 --> 00:28:27,870
I will go prepare it now.

536
00:29:04,610 --> 00:29:05,560
You've been busy all day.

537
00:29:05,560 --> 00:29:06,820
Have something to eat.

538
00:29:10,850 --> 00:29:12,670
Granny Tang has already gone to rest.

539
00:29:12,670 --> 00:29:13,460
She said

540
00:29:13,890 --> 00:29:16,220
if you want to take
Yulu and Aunt Hong away,

541
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:19,660
the carriage is at the back door
of the dyehouse.

542
00:29:21,450 --> 00:29:22,280
Stop looking.

543
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:24,210
This matter is no longer

544
00:29:24,210 --> 00:29:25,870
decided by the will of heaven.

545
00:29:26,330 --> 00:29:28,760
When you saved that child
on the mountain today,

546
00:29:28,760 --> 00:29:30,370
you didn't ask for heaven's will,

547
00:29:30,370 --> 00:29:31,090
did you?

548
00:29:36,910 --> 00:29:37,700
Right now,

549
00:29:39,060 --> 00:29:39,990
I have no choice.

550
00:29:42,950 --> 00:29:45,010
Although things are unpredictable,

551
00:29:45,630 --> 00:29:47,160
this is too much of a change.

552
00:29:48,740 --> 00:29:50,110
When we left Jinling,

553
00:29:50,980 --> 00:29:52,040
I never thought I'd be

554
00:29:52,040 --> 00:29:54,700
saving the Crown Prince
with the Iron Alliance.

555
00:29:58,020 --> 00:30:00,220
The Iron Alliance and the Crown Prince—

556
00:30:00,830 --> 00:30:02,030
I will save them both.

557
00:30:03,980 --> 00:30:06,110
-Alliance Leader!
-Alliance Leader!

558
00:30:21,110 --> 00:30:21,870
Everyone...

559
00:30:24,520 --> 00:30:26,910
Earlier, I asked Little Leaf

560
00:30:27,150 --> 00:30:28,740
to explain the whole story

561
00:30:28,740 --> 00:30:30,590
to all of you.

562
00:30:32,090 --> 00:30:34,420
You are all veterans of the Iron Alliance.

563
00:30:36,270 --> 00:30:37,050
This

564
00:30:38,220 --> 00:30:41,740
is Tie Xuan's son, Tie Fuyuan.

565
00:30:43,690 --> 00:30:44,950
From today on,

566
00:30:45,830 --> 00:30:46,540
he

567
00:30:47,540 --> 00:30:51,150
is the new Iron Alliance Leader.

568
00:30:58,410 --> 00:30:59,670
Greetings, everyone.

569
00:30:59,910 --> 00:31:01,240
I have to trouble you all

570
00:31:01,850 --> 00:31:02,540
to come

571
00:31:02,790 --> 00:31:04,680
break into that scoundrel Jin Rong's place

572
00:31:04,680 --> 00:31:06,570
today with me.

573
00:31:14,670 --> 00:31:16,780
At your command, Alliance Leader.

574
00:31:17,870 --> 00:31:20,220
-At your command, Alliance Leader!
-At your command, Alliance Leader!

575
00:31:20,220 --> 00:31:24,220
-At your command, Alliance Leader!
-At your command, Alliance Leader!

576
00:31:34,540 --> 00:31:35,940
Do you know where this is?

577
00:31:37,260 --> 00:31:38,040
Granny told me

578
00:31:38,040 --> 00:31:39,900
this is the former Tie residence.

579
00:31:41,300 --> 00:31:42,350
After Tie Xuan passed away,

580
00:31:42,350 --> 00:31:43,650
Jin Rong took over the place.

581
00:31:43,650 --> 00:31:44,830
Most of the layout in the residence

582
00:31:44,830 --> 00:31:47,290
was modified based on
the old Tie residence.

583
00:31:47,300 --> 00:31:49,100
With the Crown Prince captured,

584
00:31:49,220 --> 00:31:51,560
Jin Rong must have
strengthened all defenses.

585
00:31:51,560 --> 00:31:52,640
It won't be that easy

586
00:31:52,640 --> 00:31:53,500
for us to get in.

587
00:31:54,800 --> 00:31:56,040
This is Madam Liu,

588
00:31:56,060 --> 00:31:57,310
who is in charge of
purchasing in Jin Rong's residence.

589
00:31:57,310 --> 00:31:58,470
She is our inside contact.

590
00:31:58,470 --> 00:31:59,730
We can ask her for help.

591
00:32:00,670 --> 00:32:02,330
Greetings, Alliance Leader.

592
00:32:06,090 --> 00:32:07,110
In that case,

593
00:32:08,330 --> 00:32:09,200
I have a plan.

594
00:32:09,230 --> 00:32:22,410
[Dyeing House]

595
00:32:17,190 --> 00:32:17,910
Be careful.

596
00:32:25,150 --> 00:32:25,830
Aunt Hong,

597
00:32:26,250 --> 00:32:26,860
Yulu.

598
00:32:27,780 --> 00:32:29,440
The situation is unclear now.

599
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:31,260
I've arranged for someone

600
00:32:31,500 --> 00:32:33,700
to take you to a clinic outside the city.

601
00:32:34,070 --> 00:32:35,070
Have a rest there.

602
00:32:37,610 --> 00:32:38,300
Dingyuan,

603
00:32:38,870 --> 00:32:39,730
what about you?

604
00:32:40,010 --> 00:32:41,470
Aren't you coming with us?

605
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:43,480
I can't leave yet.

606
00:32:44,390 --> 00:32:45,590
There are some things

607
00:32:45,830 --> 00:32:46,660
I must do.

608
00:32:50,760 --> 00:32:51,540
Don't worry.

609
00:32:51,810 --> 00:32:52,480
I promise

610
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:54,290
I'll be fine.

611
00:32:57,060 --> 00:32:57,700
Aunt Hong,

612
00:32:57,980 --> 00:32:59,830
I'm leaving Yulu in your care.

613
00:33:00,060 --> 00:33:00,790
Don't worry.

614
00:33:01,040 --> 00:33:02,570
I'll take good care of Yulu.

615
00:33:03,110 --> 00:33:04,640
Go and do what you need to do.

616
00:33:12,670 --> 00:33:13,390
Careful.

617
00:33:19,630 --> 00:33:20,260
Dingyuan!

618
00:33:20,850 --> 00:33:21,910
We'll wait for you!

619
00:33:23,110 --> 00:33:24,350
You must come back!

620
00:33:41,110 --> 00:33:41,670
Halt!

621
00:33:42,130 --> 00:33:43,330
What are you here for?

622
00:33:43,340 --> 00:33:44,950
We're here to deliver meat
to the residence.

623
00:33:44,950 --> 00:33:46,950
You two look unfamiliar.

624
00:33:47,360 --> 00:33:48,290
Where is Mr. Cai?

625
00:33:49,020 --> 00:33:50,110
My father caught a cold.

626
00:33:50,110 --> 00:33:52,310
We're delivering the meat in his stead.

627
00:33:52,610 --> 00:33:53,350
Who are you?

628
00:33:54,170 --> 00:33:56,030
I am the Cai family's son-in-law.

629
00:33:56,460 --> 00:33:57,920
Who ordered the meat from you?

630
00:33:57,920 --> 00:33:59,250
Madam Liu, the manager.

631
00:34:00,500 --> 00:34:01,060
Go.

632
00:34:02,530 --> 00:34:03,790
Wait here for a moment.

633
00:34:04,590 --> 00:34:05,580
Here, let me help you carry it.

634
00:34:05,580 --> 00:34:06,180
It's fine.

635
00:34:13,080 --> 00:34:13,600
You're here.

636
00:34:13,600 --> 00:34:14,330
Madam Liu.

637
00:34:15,600 --> 00:34:17,159
Are they really from Mr. Cai's family?

638
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:18,060
Of course.

639
00:34:18,270 --> 00:34:20,469
I ordered the meat from them yesterday.

640
00:34:31,730 --> 00:34:33,000
Let them in quickly.

641
00:34:33,150 --> 00:34:35,210
Don't delay the Commander's dinner.

642
00:34:35,360 --> 00:34:35,820
Come in.

643
00:34:35,850 --> 00:34:36,350
Okay.

644
00:34:53,080 --> 00:34:53,710
General.

645
00:34:54,659 --> 00:34:55,239
Yes.

646
00:34:59,740 --> 00:35:00,360
General.

647
00:35:05,160 --> 00:35:08,250
[The young master arrives in Jinan tomorrow. Follow instructions to the letter
and be careful—do not let anything go wrong.]

648
00:35:10,580 --> 00:35:11,310
Understood.

649
00:35:12,560 --> 00:35:14,190
Move them to the shadows.

650
00:35:15,060 --> 00:35:15,660
Yes.

651
00:35:19,040 --> 00:35:20,240
Listen up, everyone!

652
00:35:53,710 --> 00:35:54,540
Jin Si.

653
00:35:55,810 --> 00:35:58,870
Do you still remember
that heavy snow outside the pass?

654
00:35:59,180 --> 00:36:01,310
There were many years with heavy snow.

655
00:36:01,870 --> 00:36:02,870
I don't know

656
00:36:03,220 --> 00:36:05,550
which one Your Highness is talking about.

657
00:36:05,810 --> 00:36:08,230
The year Grandfather
went on the northern expedition.

658
00:36:08,230 --> 00:36:09,680
In Hulan Hushiwen.

659
00:36:11,580 --> 00:36:13,440
The 12th year of the Yongle reign.

660
00:36:15,350 --> 00:36:16,950
Grandfather was in the camp,

661
00:36:17,450 --> 00:36:19,570
eating meat and drinking cold wine.

662
00:36:19,870 --> 00:36:20,810
At that time,

663
00:36:21,210 --> 00:36:23,540
you were squatting by the stove
scraping the bottom of the pot,

664
00:36:23,540 --> 00:36:25,230
your mouth full of grease.

665
00:36:25,940 --> 00:36:27,600
Do you remember what you said?

666
00:36:28,060 --> 00:36:29,620
I have said many things.

667
00:36:30,810 --> 00:36:33,070
Which one is
Your Highness referring to?

668
00:36:33,480 --> 00:36:34,540
You said then,

669
00:36:37,360 --> 00:36:39,740
as long as they are
Grandfather's descendants,

670
00:36:39,740 --> 00:36:41,400
even if it costs you your life,

671
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:43,260
you will protect them.

672
00:36:43,520 --> 00:36:44,230
Remember?

673
00:36:57,790 --> 00:36:58,920
I will never forget.

674
00:36:59,990 --> 00:37:01,720
Am I not worthy of your life?

675
00:37:03,790 --> 00:37:04,750
I thought

676
00:37:06,250 --> 00:37:08,060
I had made it very clear before.

677
00:37:10,500 --> 00:37:12,300
I really haven't figured it out.

678
00:37:15,180 --> 00:37:16,350
Where exactly

679
00:37:17,040 --> 00:37:18,420
did things go wrong

680
00:37:20,740 --> 00:37:22,860
to make you become like this?

681
00:37:29,430 --> 00:37:30,800
I always thought

682
00:37:31,790 --> 00:37:33,720
Your Highness would be different.

683
00:37:43,430 --> 00:37:44,430
Different how?

684
00:37:44,770 --> 00:37:46,870
Your bloodline was forged in battle.

685
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:49,480
You've spent time in military camps.

686
00:37:49,480 --> 00:37:51,520
You know the border situation
and understand the military's morale.

687
00:37:51,520 --> 00:37:52,460
I thought you wouldn't make

688
00:37:52,460 --> 00:37:54,190
the same choice as your father.

689
00:37:55,160 --> 00:37:55,870
Tell me—

690
00:37:56,850 --> 00:37:58,650
what is this choice you speak of?

691
00:37:59,980 --> 00:38:01,680
Moving the capital to Jinling.

692
00:38:01,680 --> 00:38:02,940
People in the court say

693
00:38:03,560 --> 00:38:05,360
it was your advice to the Emperor

694
00:38:05,660 --> 00:38:07,370
that led to this journey south.

695
00:38:07,370 --> 00:38:09,290
Emperor Taizong placed
the people's hearts and provisions

696
00:38:09,290 --> 00:38:10,500
in Beijing!

697
00:38:10,890 --> 00:38:12,150
Yet you and your father

698
00:38:12,290 --> 00:38:13,950
insist on running to Jinling!

699
00:38:20,230 --> 00:38:21,030
In my opinion,

700
00:38:21,720 --> 00:38:23,750
neither you nor your father
is fit to be a ruler.

701
00:38:23,750 --> 00:38:24,500
How dare you!

702
00:38:25,730 --> 00:38:27,210
Not fit to be a ruler?

703
00:38:28,290 --> 00:38:30,090
So the ruler you have in your mind

704
00:38:30,430 --> 00:38:31,960
is the Prince of Han, right?

705
00:38:32,810 --> 00:38:33,810
I didn't say that.

706
00:38:34,060 --> 00:38:34,990
I wouldn't dare.

707
00:38:35,230 --> 00:38:37,850
Is there anything you, Jin Si,
wouldn't dare to do?

708
00:38:37,850 --> 00:38:38,710
Your Highness,

709
00:38:39,930 --> 00:38:42,130
I am completely loyal to the Zhu family.

710
00:38:42,520 --> 00:38:43,430
My loyalty

711
00:38:44,790 --> 00:38:46,720
is out of the grace I have received.

712
00:38:49,180 --> 00:38:50,060
Loyalty?

713
00:38:50,730 --> 00:38:53,020
You colluded with my worthless brother

714
00:38:54,100 --> 00:38:57,360
to get rid of this father and son
who are not fit to be rulers.

715
00:38:58,300 --> 00:39:00,030
Is this your so-called loyalty

716
00:39:00,390 --> 00:39:01,750
and so-called grace?

717
00:39:02,560 --> 00:39:03,420
Your Highness,

718
00:39:04,100 --> 00:39:05,020
my merits

719
00:39:05,040 --> 00:39:07,790
were earned by assisting Emperor Taizong.

720
00:39:08,370 --> 00:39:11,630
The grace I received
was also bestowed by Emperor Taizong.

721
00:39:11,960 --> 00:39:12,910
My loyalty

722
00:39:13,350 --> 00:39:15,660
is not kneeling before
a fat pig like your father

723
00:39:15,660 --> 00:39:16,950
and kowtowing to show petty loyalty,

724
00:39:16,950 --> 00:39:18,210
but bringing the world

725
00:39:18,230 --> 00:39:21,690
back to the great path of
Emperor Taizong's established laws.

726
00:39:24,830 --> 00:39:26,100
Even if I have to bear

727
00:39:26,910 --> 00:39:28,790
the infamy of a rebel and traitor,

728
00:39:30,390 --> 00:39:31,320
I will accept it.

729
00:39:35,060 --> 00:39:36,120
You will accept it?

730
00:39:36,350 --> 00:39:37,410
Then let me ask you,

731
00:39:38,030 --> 00:39:40,490
are you trying to help Grandfather
protect his established laws,

732
00:39:40,490 --> 00:39:43,290
or are you holding the ladder
for the Prince of Han?

733
00:39:45,540 --> 00:39:48,400
I owe my life to Emperor Taizong.

734
00:39:52,350 --> 00:39:54,950
What does it have to do
with you and your father?

735
00:39:57,350 --> 00:39:58,400
Then do you think

736
00:39:58,880 --> 00:40:00,380
your actions

737
00:40:02,470 --> 00:40:04,070
won't let down Grandfather?

738
00:40:35,430 --> 00:40:36,790
Help!

739
00:40:37,500 --> 00:40:38,300
What's wrong?

740
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:40,710
I led them to the kitchen,

741
00:40:40,910 --> 00:40:42,230
but when I turned around,

742
00:40:42,230 --> 00:40:44,290
Mr. Cai's daughter
and son-in-law were gone.

743
00:40:44,290 --> 00:40:46,750
There were only 2 baskets
left on the ground.

744
00:40:59,930 --> 00:41:00,510
Go.

745
00:41:15,630 --> 00:41:16,890
Signal gunpowder like this

746
00:41:16,890 --> 00:41:18,280
isn't very explosive,

747
00:41:18,980 --> 00:41:20,580
but it produces thick smoke,

748
00:41:20,790 --> 00:41:23,500
enough to attract their soldiers
both in the open and in the dark.

749
00:41:23,500 --> 00:41:24,060
Take it.

750
00:41:24,890 --> 00:41:26,120
I'll go set the explosives.

751
00:41:26,120 --> 00:41:27,720
You go save the Crown Prince.

752
00:41:30,620 --> 00:41:31,480
That's enough.

753
00:41:31,730 --> 00:41:33,190
As a dignified commander,

754
00:41:33,340 --> 00:41:35,140
you're so inhospitable to your guests.

755
00:41:35,140 --> 00:41:36,940
I haven't even finished eating.

756
00:41:39,310 --> 00:41:40,060
Zhu Zhanji.

757
00:41:42,640 --> 00:41:44,440
It is important to know oneself.

758
00:41:44,850 --> 00:41:46,180
I'll go get the meat now.

759
00:41:46,700 --> 00:41:48,580
This meal of Tied Braised Pork Belly

760
00:41:48,580 --> 00:41:50,100
is my last act of kindness

761
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:52,490
before sending you on your way.

762
00:42:10,930 --> 00:42:11,500
General!

763
00:42:13,850 --> 00:42:15,310
General, a secret letter.

764
00:42:18,350 --> 00:42:18,890
You may go.

765
00:42:18,890 --> 00:42:19,400
Yes.

766
00:42:23,520 --> 00:42:25,490
[Kill him immediately
to avoid causing any more trouble.]
